THE TREND IS NOT A GOOD TREND.

00:00:53.313 --> 00:00:55.063
I DON’T THINK WE HAVE TO WORRY

00:00:55.065 --> 00:00:56.070
ABOUT A MASS SPIKE WITH

00:00:56.104 --> 00:00:57.840
RATIONING OF THE DOORSTEPS OF

00:00:57.875 --> 00:00:59.398
OUR HOSPITALS LIKE WE WERE

