00:01:10.581 --> 00:01:12.347
BECAUSE THEY ARE HAVING TROUBLE

00:01:12.348 --> 00:01:15.161
BREATHING OR ARE IN VERY SERIOUS

00:01:15.195 --> 00:01:16.961
CONDITION BECAUSE OF COVID.

00:01:16.962 --> 00:01:18.796
WE ARE ADDING, AS YOU SAID,

00:01:18.797 --> 00:01:20.675
ABOUT 170,000 NEW CASES A DAY.

00:01:20.677 --> 00:01:22.491
BUT WE ARE ONLY DIAGNOSING ABOUT

00:01:22.526 --> 00:01:24.584
ONE IN FIVE TO ONE IN TEN.

00:01:24.585 --> 00:01:25.527
THAT’S ABOUT A MILLION NEW

00:01:25.561 --> 00:01:26.887
INFECTIONS PER DAY.

00:01:26.889 --> 00:01:30.952
PEOPLE DO YOU NEED TO

00:01:30.986 --> 00:01:31.512
PRECAUTIONS.

00:01:31.513 --> 00:01:33.541
&gt;&gt; Julie: THE LINES AT TEST

00:01:33.575 --> 00:01:35.011
SITES ALSO INCREASINGLY LONG,

00:01:35.045 --> 00:01:38.606
AND IT TAKES LONGER NOW FOR LAB

00:01:38.641 --> 00:01:39.884
