00:01:39.918 --> 00:01:42.386
THE TESTS PEOPLE USE TO GET BACK

00:01:42.420 --> 00:01:43.746
IN ABOUT 2-3 DAYS ARE NOW TAKING

00:01:43.747 --> 00:01:44.469
