00:01:44.504 --> 00:01:46.159
THAT IS GOING TO COMPLICATE

00:01:46.193 --> 00:01:47.698
THINGS AS WE SEE RATES OF CASES

00:01:47.733 --> 00:01:48.383
SKYROCKET.

00:01:48.384 --> 00:01:50.714
THE DELAYS IN GETTING THOSE

00:01:50.715 --> 00:01:52.725
RESULTS BACK IS ALSO AN ISSUE.

00:01:52.759 --> 00:01:55.331
HOW MUCH SHOULD PEOPLE HEED THIS

00:01:55.366 --> 00:01:57.279
WARNING THEN TO STAY HOME,

00:01:57.313 --> 00:01:58.751
CONSIDERING, IF YOU ARE EXPOSED,

00:01:58.785 --> 00:02:00.745
YOUR TEST RESULTS ARE NOW

00:02:00.747 --> 00:02:04.333
DELAYED THE SAME WAY THEY WERE

00:02:04.334 --> 00:02:06.612
