00:02:06.613 --> 00:02:07.719
&gt;&gt; EVERYONE NEEDS TO ASSESS

00:02:07.721 --> 00:02:10.012
THEIR OWN PERSONAL RISK.

00:02:10.014 --> 00:02:12.381
WE KNEW THIS INFECTION HAD ITS

00:02:12.382 --> 00:02:13.562
DEATH OR MORTALITY SKEWED TOWARD

00:02:13.563 --> 00:02:14.767
COMORBIDITY BUT WE DIDN’T

00:02:14.768 --> 00:02:16.236
REALIZE JUST HOW SKEWED IT WAS.

00:02:16.237 --> 00:02:19.507
IN FACT, WHEN WE TALK ABOUT

00:02:19.508 --> 00:02:21.259
THOSE WITH ADVANCED AGE BEING AT

00:02:21.260 --> 00:02:23.597
INCREASED RISK, IT’S BECAUSE

00:02:23.631 --> 00:02:26.329
ADVANCED AGE IS LINEAR OR

00:02:26.363 --> 00:02:27.664
COLLINEAR WITH COMORBIDITY.

00:02:27.665 --> 00:02:29.540
TESTING IS STRAINED, BUT WE

00:02:29.574 --> 00:02:31.855
DON’T WANT TO BE REQUIRING EVERY

00:02:31.890 --> 00:02:33.933
BASKETBALL PLAYER TO HAVE TWO

00:02:33.935 --> 00:02:35.505
TESTS IN ORDER TO PLAY.

00:02:35.506 --> 00:02:37.685
THOSE ARE THE LIFESTYLE TESTING

00:02:37.686 --> 00:02:42.709
THINGS THAT ARE CLOGGING UP THE

00:02:42.710 --> 00:02:43.563
SYSTEM RIGHT NOW.

00:02:43.597 --> 00:02:46.807
&gt;&gt; Julie: THERE ARE A LOT OF

00:02:46.808 --> 00:02:47.684
COMPANIES TESTING EMPLOYEES

00:02:47.719 --> 00:02:49.291
THREE TIMES A WEEK.

00:02:49.292 --> 00:02:50.927
I KNOW SEVERAL OTHERS IN THE

00:02:50.928 --> 00:02:51.864
PRODUCTION BUSINESS THAT ARE

00:02:51.898 --> 00:02:52.802
HAVING MESS.

00:02:52.803 --> 00:02:55.534
MY QUESTION, MIGHT WE BE SEEING

00:02:55.568 --> 00:02:56.997
THE SAME HOLIDAY-DRIVEN SPIKES

00:02:57.032 --> 00:02:59.071
IN DECEMBER AND INTO JANUARY?

00:02:59.072 --> 00:03:01.100
THIS MAY BE JUST THE BEGINNING.

00:03:01.134 --> 00:03:03.921
COMING UP WE ARE GOING TO BE

00:03:03.923 --> 00:03:05.376
CELEBRATING CHRISTMAS, HANUKKAH,

00:03:05.377 --> 00:03:06.740
KWANZAA, NEW YEAR’S, AND THAT

00:03:06.741 --> 00:03:08.841
VACCINE, BY THE WAY, THE

