00:03:19.416 --> 00:03:21.376
DOES ANY OF THIS SEEM REALISTIC

00:03:21.377 --> 00:03:22.441
TO YOU?

00:03:22.443 --> 00:03:24.671
&gt;&gt; FIRST OF ALL, I THINK IT’S

00:03:24.705 --> 00:03:26.942
IMPORTANT NOT TO HAVE ONE SINGLE

00:03:26.975 --> 00:03:28.065
BLANKET RECOMMENDATION FOR

00:03:28.066 --> 00:03:29.989
