00:03:29.990 --> 00:03:32.054
OUR CONCERN IS WHEN PEOPLE ARE

00:03:32.055 --> 00:03:33.793
NOT TAKING PRECAUTIONS, AND THEY

00:03:33.795 --> 00:03:34.922
ARE HIGH RISK.

00:03:34.923 --> 00:03:36.840
WHEN WE WERE TELLING PEOPLE AT

00:03:36.874 --> 00:03:37.982
THE MEDICAL COMMUNITY TO WASH

00:03:37.983 --> 00:03:39.105
THEIR HANDS LIKE CRAZY, WE

00:03:39.106 --> 00:03:40.244
PROBABLY SHOULD HAVE BEEN

00:03:40.245 --> 00:03:41.448
TELLING THEM TO WEAR MASKS.

00:03:41.482 --> 00:03:44.413
WHEN WE TOLD PEOPLE TO STAY AT

00:03:44.414 --> 00:03:46.702
HOME, WE PROBABLY SHOULD HAVE

00:03:46.736 --> 00:03:48.303
SAID TO AVOID INDOOR CONGREGANT

00:03:48.305 --> 00:03:48.559
SETTINGS.

00:03:48.593 --> 00:03:50.055
OUR STRATEGY NEEDS TO EVOLVE.

00:03:50.056 --> 00:03:51.874
WE ARE LIKELY TO SEE INCREASES

00:03:51.875 --> 00:03:53.319
IN PEOPLE WHO ARE SORT OF IN

00:03:53.320 --> 00:03:55.343
DENIAL, MAYBE BECAUSE OF THE

00:03:55.377 --> 00:03:57.074
MIXED MESSAGING AND THE DELAYED

00:03:57.108 --> 00:03:58.574
CLINICAL SCIENCE, BUT I THINK

00:03:58.609 --> 00:04:00.176
PEOPLE NEED TO ASSESS THEIR OWN

00:04:00.210 --> 00:04:00.983
INDIVIDUAL RISK.

00:04:00.984 --> 00:04:03.254
THE VACCINE IS VERY GOOD NEWS.

00:04:03.256 --> 00:04:06.149
WE WERE TOLD IT IS 95% EFFECTIVE

00:04:06.150 --> 00:04:07.670
