00:04:07.672 --> 00:04:10.623
WHAT PEOPLE DON’T REALIZE IS SO

00:04:10.624 --> 00:04:12.867
FAR THE VACCINE TRIALS ARE

00:04:12.868 --> 00:04:15.128
SHOWING THEY ARE 100% EFFECTIVE

00:04:15.129 --> 00:04:16.459
IN PREVENTING DEATHS FROM COVID.

00:04:16.461 --> 00:04:17.583
THAT’S GOOD NEWS.

00:04:17.584 --> 00:04:20.370
I THINK WE ARE ON TRACK FOR

00:04:20.371 --> 00:04:21.929
MARCH, APRIL, AND MADE TO BE THE

00:04:21.963 --> 00:04:24.060
MONTHS OF MASS VACCINATION IN

00:04:24.062 --> 00:04:24.800
THE UNITED STATES.

